#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:5 fb69106200744b958537f1ba0427c9d7
msgid "Move a Servo"
msgstr "移动舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:7 0e2ba01fb4314e28ae2ef6f262d0181f
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used by a ground station or companion "
"computer to move a servo.  The :ref:`user wiki pages for servos is here "
"<copter:common-servo-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍地面站或伴随计算机如何使用 MAVLink 移动舵机。:ref:`舵机用户 wiki 页面请见此处 <copter:common-servo-"
"landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:10
#: ef8e377b3efb459493dab96e496f2173
msgid "Set the Servo position with MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO 设置舵机位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:12
#: 91ce716e499d4e5ea56e54154006e07b
msgid ""
"The servo's position can be set by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command, param1 and param2 fields set as specified for the "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO>`__ "
"command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO>`__ 命令的规范设置"
" command、param1 和 param2 字段来设定舵机位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:83
#: 7da23db4fdb64089b5d8e02d97cda6bc
msgid ""
"\"ServoRelayEvent: Channel x is already in use\" will be displayed if you "
"try to move a servo that is configured for use as a control surface or for "
"some other feature.  Check the :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<copter:SERVO1_FUNCTION>` parameter value and ensure it is 0 (\"Disabled\"),"
" 1 (\"RCPassThru\"), 22 (\"SprayerPump\"), 23 (\"SprayerSpinner\"), or "
"between 51 (\"RCIN1\") and 66 (\"RCIN16\")"
msgstr ""
"若尝试移动已配置为控制面或其他功能使用的舵机，将显示 「ServoRelayEvent: Channel x is already in "
"use」。请检查 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <copter:SERVO1_FUNCTION>` 参数值，确保其为 "
"0（「Disabled」）、1（「RCPassThru」）、22（「SprayerPump」）、23（「SprayerSpinner」）或 "
"51（「RCIN1」）至 66（「RCIN16」）之间。"

