#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:100
#: b756d496df5241778219001eded56003
msgid "Cycle the Servo position with MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO"
msgstr "使用 MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO 循环舵机位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:102
#: 5c323688375a485ebc669b89752f2345
msgid ""
"The servo's position can be set to cycle (i.e. toggle) between a PWM value "
"and :ref:`SERVOx_TRIM <copter:SERVO1_TRIM>` by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with fields set"
" as specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO>`__ "
"command."
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 并按照 "
"`MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_REPEAT_SERVO>`__ "
"命令的规范设置字段，使舵机位置在某个 PWM 值与 :ref:`SERVOx_TRIM <copter:SERVO1_TRIM>` 之间循环（即切换）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:180
#: 82df6a3a8e9e4dd18fd05340a6b93e6e
msgid "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 184 0 8 1200 3 1000 0 0 0``"
msgstr "``message COMMAND_LONG 0 0 184 0 8 1200 3 1000 0 0 0``"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-move-servo.rst:180
#: b0654d006970489c830c2deb65a1b0b7
msgid "Cycle servo output 8 between 1200 and 1500 3 times at 1hz"
msgstr "以 1Hz 频率将舵机输出通道 8 在 1200 和 1500 之间循环 3 次"
